cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use ENUMGRID in your work, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "ENUMGRID: the Enumeration Platform"
abstract: >-
  ENUMGRID is a network enumeration platform for authorized assessment. It pairs
  unprivileged-first host discovery with on-demand nmap service and version
  detection, correlates findings against the live NVD feed with CISA KEV and FIRST
  EPSS prioritisation, and presents the same engine through a terminal cockpit and a
  web cockpit. Every measured claim in the repository is produced by a checked-in,
  reproducible evaluation harness, and the tool reports unknowns rather than
  inventing values.
type: software
